# Secrets
.env

# Reference codebases, kept for reading.
#
# `reference/*` and not `reference/`, because git does not look INSIDE an
# excluded directory — so `!reference/portal-lite` under a `reference/` rule
# would never match, and the exception would silently do nothing.
reference/*
# Except portal-lite, which is ours and stays versioned.
!reference/portal-lite/

# SQLite database, generated by portal-lite's prisma migrate/seed.
# Path-independent: it has now moved twice, and a fixed path silently stops
# matching, which commits a dev database on the next add.
**/prisma/dev.db
**/prisma/dev.db-journal
